on to $208 million, reflecting the substantial decline in revenues from pure rigs operating.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2016 Q3","e":"l","d":"2016-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Josh D. Shanker","x":"So when you think about Diamond, whether – when shares were at $100, do you have the rightsize holding in Diamond?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2016 Q3","e":"l","d":"2016-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Josh D. Shanker","x":"Now that shares are at $20, do you have the rightsize holding?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2017 Q2","e":"l","d":"2017-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James S. Tisch","x":"Steve Lilienthal, CNA's CEO from 2001 to 2009 had the arduous task of streamlining the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2017 Q4","e":"l","d":"2018-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"In addition, during the quarter the company impaired one of its rigs and booked restructuring and separation costs as it continues to [technical difficulty] expense base.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2018 Q1","e":"l","d":"2018-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"…weather did not make up for the near-term negative revenue impact of the previously announced restructuring of existing firm transportation agreements with Southwestern Energy as well as a decline in storage and parking and lending revenues caused by unfavorable market conditions. The lower…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2018 Q2","e":"l","d":"2018-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Tisch","x":"Over the last year, CEO, Sean Fallman and his team have focused on creating greater efficiencies and streamlining production processes to attain better margins.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2018 Q2","e":"l","d":"2018-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"…year-over-year decline in net operating revenues, as incremental revenues from growth projects did not make up for the negative revenue impact including the 2017 restructuring of the firm’s transportation agreement, a decline in storage and parking and lending revenues and contract expirations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2019 Q3","e":"l","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"As revenue declines from contract expirations and restructuring were more than offset by revenues from growth projects recently placed into service.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2019 Q4","e":"l","d":"2020-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"I would highlight that we have worked diligently over the past couple of years to streamline the parent company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2020 Q3","e":"l","d":"2020-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"Since there is a contractual lag in old Sam's ability to pass through these costs to customers, the company absorbed the cost in the quarter without recognizing the offsetting revenue. [00:17:56] This large is temporary and will reverse as the costs are passed through to customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2020 Q3","e":"l","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"The company has aggressively reduced expenses, rightsize its capital, spend and worked with lenders to defer interest in principal pay downs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2020 Q4","e":"l","d":"2021-02-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Edelson","x":"Stellar performance from the recycled plastics business, organic volume growth and new business and higher year-over-year resin prices passed through to customers on a lagged basis.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2022 Q2","e":"l","d":"2022-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jane Wang","x":"Our share of Altium's income slightly improved this quarter due to price increases offsetting lower volume demand.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2022 Q3","e":"l","d":"2022-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jane Wang","x":"Our share of Altium's income improved this quarter driven by a favorable lag in passing through lower resin prices, versus last year's quarter, where increasing resin prices resulted in an unfavorable resin lag.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2024 Q4","e":"l","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Perbank","x":"And it's mostly in produce if tariffs are applied on produce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2024 Q4","e":"l","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Perbank","x":"And we are seeing these tariffs as a kind of a tax on product that will hurt consumers on both sides of the board and the force.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"L 2024 Q4","e":"l","d":"2025-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Dufrin","x":"Looking ahead, we're still seeing higher than normal pricing increases coming in from our larger global vendors, and many are requesting double-digit price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"}],"trends":{"theater":[[20,1,5987,0,0,0,5078,586],[21,1,4652,1,1,0,3923,460],[22,1,4480,0,0,0,3540,562],[23,1,475